{"work": "vatulanathasutra", "verse_idx": 0, "source_sha256": "4326c56f757c4c5b8ce6b414679a6e54b1991cd6987de49dfcb045b66c776d2c", "sanskrit": "tannaumi sāhasavaraṃ guruvaktragamyam || 1 ||", "translation": "That supreme daring (teaching), attainable through the guru's mouth — I praise it.", "status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:12:42"}
{"work": "vatulanathasutra", "verse_idx": 1, "source_sha256": "d0f92a9e80488af58956b9861343c641f9c213f7554948f4378db5893f0efd1a", "sanskrit": "ko'pyanuttaracidvyomasvabhāvo jayatādajaḥ || 2 ||", "translation": "May the unborn one prevail — whosoever he be — whose nature is the supreme consciousness-space.", "status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:12:42"}
{"work": "vatulanathasutra", "verse_idx": 2, "source_sha256": "f03404ab6b29da8953146192e6b2ae4dfa3c8258b9947f6a898960299647d59f", "sanskrit": "pūjyapūjakapūjābhiḥ projjhitaṃ yannamāmi tat || 3 ||", "translation": "That (reality) which is cast off by the triad of the worshipped, the worshipper, and the worship — that I salute.", "status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:12:42"}
{"work": "vatulanathasutra", "verse_idx": 3, "source_sha256": "0c5ad611ca9957400be55ded6855ac947a540bc9cd00196d3a52be00bb505b75", "sanskrit": "mahāvyomasamāviṣṭastisṭhāmyasminnirāvilaḥ || 4 ||", "translation": "Absorbed in the great void, I abide in this (very state), undisturbed.", "status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:12:42"}
{"work": "vatulanathasutra", "verse_idx": 4, "source_sha256": "bf888a0d4ac1b9449ca5fd166c6b0bb6c79afab963f32220941739727efbca47", "sanskrit": "saṃvidvikalpasaṃkalpaghaṭṭanaṃ naumyanuttaram || 5 ||", "translation": "I praise the supreme — the stirring of consciousness by conceptual differentiation and constructive imagination.", "status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:12:42"}
{"work": "vatulanathasutra", "verse_idx": 5, "source_sha256": "e333a817e8b53761f244a4341c55ac41ae72716354fe616e0f277c69029547f1", "sanskrit": "kenāpi kriyate samyakparatattvopabṛṃhitā || 6 ||", "translation": "By whomever (at all) it is effected, it is rightly augmented by the supreme reality.", "status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:12:42"}
{"work": "vatulanathasutra", "verse_idx": 6, "source_sha256": "f5db01920d8bde6e0d63eeb4d28405fbd61fb5ad42dc84a5f8650c334b1cc8d7", "sanskrit": "mahāsāhasavṛttyā svarūpalābhaḥ || 1 ||", "translation": "Through the mode of great daring, (there is) attainment of one's own essential nature.", "status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:13:37"}
{"work": "vatulanathasutra", "verse_idx": 7, "source_sha256": "a310af4a909b719add363bd83410ec8d94924009db281c5459cd3f1a57458f78", "sanskrit": "vakṣyamāṇakathitakrameṇā-dhigantavyaḥ || 1 ||", "translation": "It is to be understood by the sequence of what will be said and what has been said.", "status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:13:37"}
